00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.199 align:start position:19%
is if your palm is like this, it can
rotate your palm to neutral. And if your

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:36.160 align:start position:19%
palm is like this, it can rotate your
palm to neutral. So, it's actually an

00:06:34.639 --> 00:06:39.680 align:start position:19%
opposite rotator depending on the
position of the hand. So if you want to

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:42.880 align:start position:19%
